==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[stabilise]] (UK)

===Verb===
{{en-verb|stabiliz|ing}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To make [[stable]].
#: ''Jody '''stabilized''' the table by putting a book under the short leg.''
# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} To become [[stable]].
#: ''The country will '''stabilize''' after the next election ends.''

====Related terms====
* [[stabilizer]]
* [[stabilization]]

